  "We bridge human cognition and embodied AI to understand how social intelligence takes shape through interaction.": "We bridge human cognition and embodied AI to understand how social intelligence takes shape through interaction.",
  "We bring together curious minds who are passionate about scientific discovery and interdisciplinary research at the intersection of cognitive science, artificial intelligence, and engineering.": "We bring together curious minds who are passionate about scientific discovery and interdisciplinary research at the intersection of cognitive science, artificial intelligence, and engineering.",
  "We investigate how humans perceive and integrate multimodal social cues to understand the cognitive mechanisms underlying social interaction. Inspired by these mechanisms, we develop computational models and embodied robotic systems to advance artificial social intelligence. Through human-robot interaction studies, we explore how people interact with intelligent agents, establishing a bidirectional link between human social cognition and embodied artificial intelligence.": "We investigate how humans perceive and integrate multimodal social cues to understand the cognitive mechanisms underlying social interaction. Inspired by these mechanisms, we develop computational models and embodied robotic systems to advance artificial social intelligence. Through human-robot interaction studies, we explore how people interact with intelligent agents, establishing a bidirectional link between human social cognition and embodied artificial intelligence.",
  "We welcome researchers and students interested in social cognition, human-AI interaction and embodied AI. Contact us to discuss opportunities to work with SEIL Lab.": "We welcome researchers and students interested in social cognition, human-AI interaction and embodied AI. Contact us to discuss opportunities to work with SEIL Lab.",
